[issue-label-gate-cases release='v7.7' cutoff='2026-10-02T23:59:59Z'
  [doc [#
scripts/issue_label_gate_cases.cxd — issue-label-gate's case table (#1781,
RULED: LBL-1, SHIP-2, CXF-8). `cx scripts/issue_label_gate.cx --self-test`
grades every case offline on PLANTED GitHub answers: [private] is the JSON of
cx-private's open issues, each [component repo=] that repository's, and
[register] stands in for scripts/issue_label_exclusions.cxd. The release is
the root's release= (a made-up one, so the table carries no real version) and
the cutoff its cutoff=.

want= is every refusal the gate must make, space-separated, in order:
  a:<repo>#N         an open cx-private issue created after the cutoff without
                     the release label, not excluded, not on a [parking]
                     milestone (the owner parked it out of the release)
  b:<repo>#N         an open cx-private issue on a milestone no [parking] row names
  c:<repo>#N         an open component issue whose title lacks `<release> `
  register:<repo>#N  an exclusion row without a why= (it excludes nothing)
want='' is a case the gate passes.

  [line '…']          (optional, inside a case) a line the refusals must
                     PRINT, in order; a case with any grades all of them
  [read-case repo= why= want=]  the sentence a read that failed prints
                     (exit 2) for that repository and reason
#]]

