  [; What a refusal PRINTS (run4 of batch H4: the flow's red message tails the
     step's stdout, and the refusals went to stderr alone, so the table it
     showed named none). A case with [line] rows grades every printed line,
     in order: the key, why, and the issue's title -- the gate's header
     promises "each named, with its title". ]
